{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06544","headline":"荐玄德公庙 · 储光羲","name":"荐玄德公庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神道本无已，成化亦自然。\n君居寥天上，德在玉华泉。\n真游践王豫，永日迟云仙。\n表微在营道，明祀将祈年。\n灵山俯新邑，松上生彩烟。\n岂知穆天子，远去瑶池边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}